WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.220
What makes us different, or at least what our clients tell us,

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:04.720
is that we are genuinely result-driven.

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:07.660
Today with AI, you tend to see tools bolted together,

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:10.000
an urge to keep testing whatever new tool comes out,

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:13.200
the hype, the ads, the people who make a job out of testing new tools.

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.840
You get lost, and you would like to know where to go.

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:20.020
In our solutions, we only offer the 20 % that brings 80 % of the results.

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:24.440
So it is AI, but built on foundations we use every time,

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:26.560
that have already proved themselves with all our clients,

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:30.360
and with other companies that have been using them longer, in the United States for example.

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:33.640
Second point: we genuinely think long term.

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:37.860
Meaning we go into your processes and build these systems around your processes,

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.400
so that they grow over time with your processes, with your teams and with you.

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:43.000
It is a long-term investment.

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:48.000
We are talking 5 to 10 years minimum, even though today, in the world we are in, AI moves very fast.

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:50.840
And so you have to change tools often.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.840
That is why with a custom tool, you do not need to.

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:55.260
Why? Because it grows with you, as a chain of systems.

00:00:55.960 --> 00:01:00.400
Then, speed and effectiveness, if I dare say it, that hold up under anything.

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:04.080
We commit to our clients to answer them within 30 minutes during the day,

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:09.100
Monday to Friday. At the weekend, we commit to answering within 4 to 8 hours.

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:14.120
So the thing is, we are genuinely always available, always listening,

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:16.520
we take our clients' calls, we even call them ourselves,

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:22.200
because for us the client experience, and above all the client always knowing where the project stands,

00:01:22.980 --> 00:01:26.520
and therefore the next steps, how we do this, how we handle that,

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:30.480
and when their software will be finished, and once finished, how we will grow it, and so on.

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:31.860
That is the most important thing for us.

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:33.640
So we are always there, answering quickly.

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:36.680
You can test it, by the way: we will answer in under 15 minutes.

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:38.700
Next, you stay autonomous.

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:41.920
Of course, we write the code for you, we build the tool for you,

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:44.160
but the tool belongs to you.

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:48.120
It is your process, your tool, your software, your AI. The AI belongs to you.

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:50.780
If overnight, for whatever reason, and we hope not,

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:53.520
we stop working together, you still have full control of the tool.

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:56.540
And then you can move to other suppliers or carry on in house,

00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:59.420
we train you as well, so you can grow that product without us.

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:01.640
And finally, the results guarantee.

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:03.340
We commit with all our clients:

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:07.540
we always start by setting the results to reach, at the beginning of the contract.

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:11.440
And we commit that if we do not reach those results,

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:12.820
within the time we set ourselves,

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:15.200
we keep working until we do, free of charge.

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:18.760
So for you, it is an investment where you are certain to get a result.

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:21.860
Why? Because we commit to that result.

00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:25.200
So if we do not reach it, which has never happened so far,

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:26.660
and which I think will never happen, honestly,

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:27.960
but it is still possible,

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:29.940
then we work for free, we push past that barrier,

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:31.440
until you reach the result.

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:35.500
We are also at a stage where, for us, the client experience matters most,

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:38.340
because we are arriving on this market, even though we have been in it a year,

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.760
and there are players, in the United States particularly, who have been in it longer.

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:44.780
So we really want to make a point of the client experience,

00:02:45.020 --> 00:02:46.120
and above all of your results.

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:48.720
We get a result if you get a result.

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:49.900
So there you go, that is the agency model.

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:54.520
That is all from NateSystem. Go and look at our client cases, our resources.

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:56.700
Recently, we built applications for you,

00:02:56.800 --> 00:02:58.340
completely free, that you can use,

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:00.460
to manage your cash flow or your stock in particular.

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:04.100
So you go to the resources page of our site,

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:07.620
you click, you sign in, and you have access to your free tools.
